<title>USA: West St. Paul, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>West St. Paul, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc., said it won $2.500 million of West Saint Paul, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.00 percent.</p>
</text>
